# dist/ is intentionally committed: it's what the hook and skills actually
# run (see hooks/hooks.json and skills/*/SKILL.md). Anyone who installs this
# plugin — via --plugin-dir or a marketplace — needs working code immediately,
# without running a Node/TypeScript build first. Run `npm run build` after
# editing src/ and commit the updated dist/ alongside it.
